"entity": {
"name": "CTS Eventim AG & Co.  KGaA",
"description": "CTS Eventim AG & Co. KGaA engages in ticketing and live entertainment event management. It operates through the Ticketing and Live Entertainment segments. The Ticketing segment includes the production, sale, broker, distribution, and marketing of tickets for concerts, festivals, theatre, musicals, trade fairs, art, cinema, exhibitions, edutainment, sports, and other events. The Live Entertainment segment refers to planning, preparing, and execution of concert events and tours, festivals, and other live events. The company was founded on November 4, 1989 and is headquartered in Hamburg, Germany.",
